            section HEADER and folds nowhere, so at 390 it was a 30px button carrying a chevron and
            nothing else — the identical defect the Backups log hit on 2026-08-12, one surface later.
            `triggerIcon` is the prop written for exactly this and it had zero call sites; the glyph
            comes from `entityIcon`, the ONE concept-glyph map, rather than being picked here. */}
        <FacetFilter label="Bases" name="rpttrendbase" triggerIcon={entityIconClass('base')} groups={[{ items: trendBaseItems }]} end />
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="rptk-trend-grid">
      {report.trends.metrics.map((m: ReportTrendMetric) => (
        <div class="rptk-trend-card">
